      "writtenOn": "2022-11-22T20:20:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t get this. Wouldn\u0027t it make more sense if the partner Accepted when the stored EUDO is non-zero? I don\u0027t see you setting the EUDO in the test, so I guess it will default to 0, and the partner will Accept.",
      "revId": "b9bb3284e073585d1ce07d994259c98f0d14da55",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
