      "writtenOn": "2022-11-28T18:15:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At this stage, I prefer to use the bool field to control the Accept/Reject explicitly. I do think for completeness, it will make sense to validate the Enter_USB message that is formed by the PE. I will add a TODO for now in the Enter_USB test suite.",
      "parentUuid": "442b5087_c45504e0",
      "revId": "b9bb3284e073585d1ce07d994259c98f0d14da55",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
