      "writtenOn": "2022-11-22T22:14:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can see this both ways. Currently, this test is specific to a passive cable with USB4 support. So it\u0027s verifying that a passive cable with USB4 support is found prior to attempting to simulating the AP requesting to attempt USB4 entry. When the test cases get expanded to handle active cables with USB3.2 support, then there would need to be tests to make sure those cable checks work.",
